<title>USA: Dime Savings names mortgage banking CEO.</title>
<headline>Dime Savings names mortgage banking CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dime Bancorp Inc's The Dime Savings Bank of New York said on Friday it named Fred Koons chairman and chief executive of its mortgage banking business.</p>
<p>Koons, a consultant on Koons mortgage banking strategy for the past four months, would work on building the unit into a multi-regional mortgage banking company.</p>
<p>Koons was previously chairman and chief executive officer of Chase Manhattan Mortgage Corp, where he was responsible for all aspects of Chase's residential mortgage banking activities in the United States, Dime said.</p>
</text>
